{"availability":"available","full":"alexpovel/srgn","name":"srgn","description":"A grep-like tool which understands source code syntax and allows for manipulation in addition to search","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":913,"forks":10,"created":"2023-05-16T15:32:07Z","updated":"2026-10-01T15:19:11Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://crates.io/crates/srgn/","topics":["abstract-syntax-tree","c","clang","cli","csharp","go","grep","hacktoberfest","hcl","python","regex","rust","rust-lang","sed","tr","tree-sitter","typescript"],"demo":"https://tree-sitter.github.io/tree-sitter/playground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.662Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.662Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.662Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:38:27.724Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:10.414Z","stars":913,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.238Z","stars":913,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:09.662Z","stars":913,"forks":10}],"technologies":["Python","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A grep-like tool which understands source code syntax and allows for manipulation in addition to search.","Like grep, regular expressions are a core primitive. Unlike grep, additional capabilities allow for higher precision, with options for manipulation. This allows srgn to operate along dimensions regular expressions and IDE tooling (Rename all, Find all references, ...) alone cannot, complementing them.","srgn is organized around actions to take (if any), acting only within precise, optionally language grammar-aware scopes. In terms of existing tools, think of it as a mix of tr, sed, ripgrep and tree-sitter, with a design goal of simplicity: if you know regex and the basics of the language you are working with, you are good to go."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alexpovel/srgn/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c0840d6e0fb9fd720bab2ed949349ac2df1c06eb90a43